This fork's distribution is named `meridian-mmm-fork`, not `google-meridian`.
The import path is unchanged (`import meridian`), but the published package is
deliberately distinct so it cannot be mistaken for Google's release.

No change alters the model's statistical specification. Feature requests that
would have done so are declined in TRIAGE.md with reasons.
